& [ConstraintReapplicationTrace] shows the ledger survived every fold
  + fold_1 preserved source, authority absence, stable identity, and single-transition-waist constraints
  + fold_2 preserved exact attribution, immutable versions, and no path-or-digest identity shortcuts
  + fold_3 preserved no shared mutation, effect gating, deterministic fallback, and no hidden-state dependency
  + fold_4 preserved typed time, privacy, retention, non-atomic observation, and provider separation
  + fold_5 preserved external source fidelity, history immutability, candidate-learning status, and no private reasoning import
  + fold_6 preserved target separation, loss visibility, proof independence, and Observer admission
  + fold_7 preserved unsigned status and moved operational candidates to the downstream frontier
  + [constraint_collision_count] is 0 within this exploded candidate

& [PruningTrace] preserves rejected and deferred material
  + [rejected] is hidden-state or chain-of-thought integration because transportable SOP state uses explicit artifacts
  + [rejected] is one Git commit per moment because event identity and snapshot cadence are separate from Git projection cadence
  + [rejected] is Planner or Calendar authority by inference because proposals and external effects require explicit admission
  + [rejected] is concurrent mutation of one live state because versioned message exchange supplies inspectable coordination
  + [rejected] is rear reflection rewriting history because learning must preserve the original forecast and intent
  + [deferred] is live calendar and notification providers until capability, privacy, reconciliation, and effect contracts exist
  + [deferred] is real concurrent models until deterministic tandem state and crash recovery are proved
  + [deferred] is automatic Git export until materiality, retention, repository, and projection policy are canonical
  + [deferred] is learned planning, routing, and weight update until exact corpus, evaluation, and training authority exist
  + [deferred] is FPGA compilation until SOP hardware target semantics and correspondence proofs are canonical

& [GrowthSeedSet] preserves healthy next work without claiming completion
  + [GS-001] semantic refinement and term map for Calendar authority surface, material moment, ChangeCapsule, lane, join, and compiler walk
  + [GS-002] data-design records with keys, cardinality, ownership, retention, sensitivity, lifecycle, and migration boundaries
  + [GS-003] full Walking Attention import fidelity record after repository state and file digests are reverified
  + [GS-004] justification graph with alternatives for event sourcing, snapshot cadence, scheduling, lane coordination, and compiler invalidation
  + [GS-005] registry records and satisfaction signature binding source, exploded, canonical, traces, and authority scope
  + [GS-006] deterministic logical-time fake Calendar, repository, tandem, and compiler proof only after signed implementation authority
  + [GS-007] later provider, real concurrency, Git projection, learning, and hardware profiles as separate source-governed stages

& [ExplosionQualityGate] is truthful for this stage
  + [coverage_check] is passed for obligations, interfaces, constraints, variants, failures, roles, data, state, services, policies, proof, lifecycle, and edge cases
  + [truth_check] is passed because source uncertainty and authority absence remain visible
  + [semantic_refinement_check] is provisional because this artifact refines terms but does not replace the required separate full-SJS refinement trace
  + [source_grounding_check] is passed against immutable source hash and assessment lineage
  + [constraint_check] is passed for the exploded candidate with zero known collisions
  + [pruning_check] is passed with rejected and deferred material preserved
  + [growth_check] is passed with downstream seeds kept outside accepted completion
  + [inward_depth_check] is passed for six actionable depth contracts at planning depth
  + [subcomponent_weaving_check] is passed at current artifact level with explicit existing-fabric edges
  + [cross_weaving_check] is passed at current artifact level while canonical conflict reconciliation remains downstream
  + [exhaustion_check] is seven-fold phase lock for this unsigned explosion stage
  + [boundary_check] is passed with live effects and providers excluded
  + [implementation_readiness] is false until full SJS and signed bounded authority

& [ExplosionDecision] is phase-lock the specification shape and continue SJS
  + [stable_core] is Planner-forward, repository-preserved, rear-reviewed, Observer-admitted ChangeCapsule progression
  + [stable_data_waist] is immutable versions, typed time, material events, snapshots, PlanRevision, CalendarItem, ChangeCapsule, LaneCursor, ReflectionReturn, and CompilerGeneration
